# Canvas-only site

This site has a single presentation theme: **Canvas Group** (`data-theme="canvas"`).

The former Calicon steel-grey + gold marketing theme was removed. Do not reintroduce:

- `ThemeSplit`, `ThemeProvider`, or `useTheme` theme switching
- `data-theme="calicon"` tokens or Calicon chrome (`SiteHeader` / `SiteFooter`, `btn-calicon-*`)
- Dual Canvas/Calicon page trees

## Do this on every UI change

- Implement for Canvas (`src/components/canvas/*`, Canvas-scoped CSS, existing page views).
- Prefer Canvas markup and tokens already in the design system.
- Verify Canvas after changes.

## Brand vs theme

**Calicon** remains the company/brand name in copy, SEO, contact, and assets (`calicon-lockup.svg`, `calicap-*` content modules). That is not a second theme — keep brand content; do not revive the dual theme architecture.
